comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-25T06:25:01.526Z","harness:claude-code","Evidence 2026-07-25: created pm-42p9nk, pm-wt43zj, pm-tuadp2, pm-3oqjnc, pm-zlv8jl, pm-e6tm5c, pm-xgcp18, pm-f86lth, pm-yf07b7, pm-p1g43q, pm-mn4zas in this session with no PM_AUTHOR set. Every one carries 'author: unknown' in its .toon and an unknown-author create entry in its history stream, while subsequent pm update calls on the same items in the same shell recorded author 'harness:claude-code' with author_source 'detected'. The divergence isolates the defect to the create/copy selectAuthor duplicates rather than to detection itself."
